<title>FRANCE: Matra in French GSM deal with Pioneer.</title>
<headline>Matra in French GSM deal with Pioneer.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matra Communication said it had signed a contract with Pioneer Setton SA for the supply of GSM mobile phones to be sold in France under the Pioneer brand.</p>
<p>Pioneer Setton is a distribution joint-venture between Japan's Pioneer Electronic Corp and Jack G. Setton.</p>
<p>No financial details were disclosed.</p>
<p>Matra is part of the Lagardere Groupe.</p>
